   "score": 0,
   "created_utc": "2017-11-11T16:43:25Z",
   "edited": false,
   "license": "CC BY-SA 3.0",
   "body_html": "Thanks it was the main problem, I changed the loop and it seems it works. but if I free values in loop does it work?"
  },
  {
   "post_type": "comment",
   "post_id": 81430903,
   "parent_id": 47239965,
   "parent_type": "answer",
   "author_user_id": 8316315,
